    "name": "extracting-browser-history-artifacts",
    "description": "Extracts and analyzes browser history, cookies, cache, downloads, and bookmarks from Chrome, Firefox, and Edge using sqlite3, DB Browser for SQLite, Hindsight, and NirSoft tools (BrowsingHistoryView, ChromeCacheView, MZCacheView). Use when performing digital forensics or incident response on a disk image or live system and you need timeline evidence of a user's web activity.",
